{"pageid":3489,"title":"Version 1.38.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.38.0</span>","revid":15637,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.38.0\">Version 1.38.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 19th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added <a href=\"/wiki/Junior_Scientist\" title=\"Junior Scientist\">Scientist</a>, she'll tell you when the next meteor hits for a price</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Badges\" title=\"Badges\">Familiar Place</a> badge is now obtainable</li>\n<li>Added a pathway towards the <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">mysterious mushrooms</a></li>\n<li>Added a sign to help signify where to sell resources</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Improved obtainability of <a href=\"/wiki/Badges\" title=\"Badges\">Burning Doorway</a> badge</li>\n<li>Version # now shows in loading screen</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious mushroom</a> entrance ramp is less steep</li>\n<li>Removed the rocks from the grasslands, to better open the area</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added more antigravity regions to improve getting hit</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.38.1\">Version 1.38.1</span></h2>\n<p><b>August 19th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:_2\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added Slate below all acid</li>\n<li>Added translational string to <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a></li>\n<li>Added new pathway for the <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">mysterious mushroom</a> cave</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:_2\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Increased spawn rate of trees 